IMAPAccount personal
Host imap.example.com
User user@example.com
PassCmd "gpg --quiet --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty --decrypt ~/.mail-password.gpg"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore personal-remote
Account personal

MaildirStore personal-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/personal/
Inbox ~/Mail/personal/INBOX

Channel personal
Far :personal-remote:
Near :personal-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
